# CR 700.13: each spell is a crime of its own, so two Lightning Bolts at Bot2 are two crimes. Raven of Fell Omens
# "triggers only once each turn": the first crime drains, the second does not (Bot2 at 20 - 1 - 3 - 3 = 13). On Bot2's
# turn, a new turn, Bot1's third Bolt at Bot2 is a third crime, and the Raven triggers again (Bot2 at 9, Bot1 at 22).

